<div id="pf21" class="pf w0 h0" data-page-no="21"><div class="pc pc21 w0 h0"><img class="bi x4 y391 w4 h39" alt="" src="bg21.png"/><div class="t m0 x4 hd y34 ff9 fs2 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff2">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">6<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _c"> </span>总线系统<span class="_ _65"> </span><span class="ff3">6.2<span class="_ _c"> </span></span>总线仲裁</span></div><div class="t m0 x14 h14 y1b9 ff9 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _4"> </span><span class="ff6">6.2<span class="_ _24"> </span><span class="ff1">总线仲裁</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x12 h7 y238 ff3 fs2 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="_ _13"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">集中式仲裁：总线仲裁逻辑集中于一个单元。</span></div><div class="t m0 x52 h7 y239 ff3 fs2 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">(a).<span class="_ _13"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">链式查询方式</span></div><div class="t m0 x53 h7 y29f ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">只用很少几根线就能按一定优先次序实现总线仲裁，很容易扩充设备。</div><div class="t m0 x53 h7 y2a0 ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">询问链的电路故障很敏感。</div><div class="t m0 x53 h7 y2a1 ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">需要<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">3<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>根线（<span class="ff3">BS</span>、<span class="ff3">BR</span>、<span class="ff3">BG</span>）</div><div class="t m0 x52 h7 y392 ff3 fs2 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">(b).<span class="_ _13"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">计数器定时查询方式</span></div><div class="t m0 x53 h7 y393 ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">每次计数可以从“<span class="ff3">0</span>”开始，也可以从中止点开始。</div><div class="t m0 x53 h7 y394 ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">需要<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑙<span class="_ _10"></span>𝑜𝑔</span></div><div class="t m0 xd0 h16 y395 ffa fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">2</div><div class="t m0 xf2 h7 y394 ff8 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑛<span class="_ _14"> </span><span class="ffb">+<span class="_ _14"> </span><span class="ffa">2<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">根线（设备地址线和<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">BS</span>、<span class="ff3">BR</span>）<span class="_ _1"></span>。</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x52 h7 y396 ff3 fs2 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">(c).<span class="_ _13"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">独立请求方式</span></div><div class="t m0 x53 h7 y397 ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">响应时间快。</div><div class="t m0 x53 h7 y398 ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">对优先次序的控制灵活。</div><div class="t m0 x53 h7 y399 ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">可以用屏蔽（禁止）某个请求的办法。</div><div class="t m0 x2f h7 y39a ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">当代总线标准普遍采用独立请求方式。</div><div class="t m0 x12 h7 y39b ff3 fs2 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span class="_ _13"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">分布式仲裁：每个设备都有自己的仲裁逻辑。</span></div><div class="t m0 x4 hd y5d ff9 fs2 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5c"> </span><span class="fc7"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">29<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>页<span class="_ _0"> </span></span><span class="_ _5c"> </span><span class="fc9"></span></span></div></div><div class="pi" data-data='{"ctm":[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}'></div></div>
